    "detailed_description": "<h1>FOR DOG LOVERS</h1><p></p><br><h1>RECOMMENDED FOR YOU</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The Gameplay<br>Let's get some slimes!<br><br>Limited movement.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181700/extras/39cc0a6a3c2871a9b5f593a8239da28a.poster.avif?t=1697552896\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181700/extras/39cc0a6a3c2871a9b5f593a8239da28a.webm?t=1697552896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181700/extras/39cc0a6a3c2871a9b5f593a8239da28a.mp4?t=1697552896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Sometimes the door will need keys.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181700/extras/8bfff2ff943e3f46bc02362273bfe92f.poster.avif?t=1697552896\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181700/extras/8bfff2ff943e3f46bc02362273bfe92f.webm?t=1697552896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181700/extras/8bfff2ff943e3f46bc02362273bfe92f.mp4?t=1697552896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Think carefully about every step until you reach the door.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181700/extras/0127191c4f82aa090546e1467e2b7a9b.poster.avif?t=1697552896\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181700/extras/0127191c4f82aa090546e1467e2b7a9b.webm?t=1697552896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181