r><br>Features:<br>\u2666 3 Worlds with unique environments<br>\u2666 40 hand-craft levels<br>\u2666 Difficulty progression for a growing challenge over the levels<br>\u2666 Beautiful pixel art<br>\u2666 A lot of slimes to slay!",
